\subsection{Experiment on Real-world Datasets}

{\bf Setup Details.}
In order to verify the effectiveness of {\sc Mesa} in practical applications, we extend the experiments to real-world imbalanced classification tasks from the UCI repository~\cite{Dua2019uci} and KDD CUP 2004. 
To ensure a thorough assessment, these datasets vary widely in their properties, with the imbalance ratio (IR) ranging from 9.1:1 to 111:1, dataset sizes ranging from 531 to 145,751, and number of features ranging from 6 to 617 
(Please see Table~\ref{table:datasets} in Section~\ref{section:implementation-details} for detailed information).
